I get off the bus near my work.
I hold on to my scarf.
The weather is very wild today.
I walk down the street.
Suddenly it becomes very windy.
A strong wind blows against me.
I have my open umbrella in my hand.
But the wind is too strong.
It quickly becomes a problem.
The umbrella flies from side to side.
It is impossible now.
I struggle with it.
I finally close the umbrella.
It is very cold without it.
The rain hits my face.
I hurry through the wind.
The office entrance is right ahead.
I step into the building.
Fortunately, it is warm and quiet in here.
